00:34:25,241 --> 00:34:26,240
I wouldn't either.

531
00:34:26,241 --> 00:34:30,240
So, you know, it's a favorite saying around camp

532
00:34:30,241 --> 00:34:32,240
is we wouldn't get out of the electric chair to drive it,

