00:42:13,921 --> 00:42:18,660
to run the quarter mile, driven by the thrill of speed

674
00:42:18,661 --> 00:42:20,260
and the need to win.

675
00:42:23,180 --> 00:42:27,180
It's just the challenge and the testing yourself,

